 "_adaptation": "Weapon damage/HP/range/accuracy, Hull/REPM/booster HP and the booster maximum 3-10% values are the official FAQ values; HP/damage +2% per level (L16 = L1 x 1.30). Deflector accumulation rate is +1% of the base per level (120 min/h -> L16 138 min/h; prime time x5). The Deflector module's separate 1,040,000 HP value is a local value not verified in the source. Numeric fire intervals (laser 1.5/2.5/3 s, rocket 4 s), repair speed, installation time (50 s), deflector accumulation (48 h), emergency repair cost (500 U), module demolition rewards, prime time 18:00-21:00 and alien raids are single-player adaptation. Virtual rival module HP/damage is at full value by default (multiplier 1.0); it used to be 0.2/0.05. Damaged module HP in existing saves is not refilled automatically.",
